{"unit_id":"drscrewdriver__dsh-llm-openai-completions#card-zh","repo":"drscrewdriver/dsh-llm-openai-completions","commit":"d00762059e712e78688ac958b8492c9398489b3c","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-llm-openai-completions 是一个面向 DSH 的模型传输插件，适用于 Web、TUI 等客户端。它通过全局流式事件接管所选自定义模型路由，并从 llm-pi-ai 读取网关地址与模型能力。主要功能包括 OpenAI Chat Completions、Anthropic Messages 和 OpenAI Responses 传输，按模型配置处理思考参数，发送图片、音频、视频和 PDF，并提供 read_video 工具及提示词来源接口。适合使用 vLLM、LM Studio 或自托管代理的 DSH 用户。需配置模型路由；若路由声明凭据变量，需提供对应密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:178-220","src/index.ts:233-265","src/adapter/adapter.ts:126-160","src/video-tool.ts:112-130"]}
